Date: Thu, 4 Jun 2026 12:45:56 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] profile DB: dronet hetero cycles from bit-exact FireSim
 measurement

Re-ingested measured per-op cycles from a hetero FireSim run that
verifies bit-exact (max_abs_err=0) on PyTorch golden. Previous
values were measured against a different toolchain / kernel set
and were ~3-7x optimistic for gemmini_q31 conv2d and ~50x
optimistic for V256D128_rvv batchnorm/relu, which is why the
predicted Gantt looked drastically different from actual.

Backups preserved at *.prebitexact_backup. Source uartlog:
ModelBlaster artifacts/audit/firesim_dronet_gemmini_bit_exact.uartlog
